    );font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:400;margin:0;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;}</style><p class="css-enkov7">Smart task and text handling powered by a flexible AI. Create text prompts to perform standard tasks like extracting lead (or other) data or answer discrete questions like &quot;where should this message be routed?&quot;. Or, create your own!</p></div></a><ul aria-label="Apps" class="css-8g0hyk"><li class="css-oediup"><a aria-label="SourceForge integration details" data-testid="category-app-card--item" href="https://zapier.com/apps/sourceforge/integrations" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="css-ttsy6z"><div class="css-14j7rvi"><div class="css-wmr1hw"><span class="_service-icon_13bft_1" data-border="true" data-shadow="false" data-background="default" data-size="30" data-zds="true" data-testid="ServiceIconShell" style="--width:30px;--height:30px;--border-radius:3px"><img class="_img_nlcen_1" height="20" alt="SourceForge logo" aria-hidden="false" data-testid="img" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.zapier.com/img/developer_cli/5826a2f7be8e351e753145040bcbd7d7.png?size=64x64" width="20" style="width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:var(--zds-radius-none);object-fit:contain;overflow:hidden"/></span></div><div class="css-9y7o3"><span class="_service-icon_13bft_1" data-border="true" data-shadow="false" data-background="default" data-size="40" data-zds="true" data-testid="ServiceIconShell" style="--width:40px;--height:40px;--border-radius:5px"><img class="_img_nlcen_1" height="30" alt="SourceForge logo" aria-hidden="false" data-testid="img" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.zapier.com/img/developer_cli/5826a2f7be8e351e753145040bcbd7d7.png?size=64x64" width="30" style="width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:var(--zds-radius-none);object-fit:contain;overflow:hidden"/></span></div><div class="css-34k981"><span class="css-1ncmxc0"><h2 class="css-12fk9bn">SourceForge</h2></span><div class="css-ims7u7"><p class="css-1pl7f1k">SourceForge is a complete software discovery, review, and comparison platform.</p></div></div></div></a></li><li class="css-oediup"><a aria-label="Reply.Reviews integration details" data-testid="category-app-card--item" href="https://zapier.com/apps/reply-reviews/integrations" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="css-ttsy6z"><div class="css-14j7rvi"><div class="css-wmr1hw"><span class="_service-icon_13bft_1" data-border="true" data-shadow="false" data-background="default" data-size="30" data-zds="true" data-testid="ServiceIconShell" style="--width:30px;--height:30px;--border-radius:3px"><img class="_img_nlcen_1" height="20" alt="Reply.Reviews logo" aria-hidden="false" data-testid="img" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.zapier.com/img/developer_cli/a3bd2a6fa6d63e6b60455a77924ec379.png?size=64x64" width="20" style="width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:var(--zds-radius-none);object-fit:contain;overflow:hidden"/></span></div><div class="css-9y7o3"><span class="_service-icon_13bft_1" data-border="true" data-shadow="false" data-background="default" data-size="40" data-zds="true" data-testid="ServiceIconShell" style="--width:40px;--height:40px;--border-radius:5px"><img class="_img_nlcen_1" height="30" alt="Reply.Reviews logo" aria-hidden="false" data-testid="img" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.zapier.com/img/developer_cli/a3bd2a6fa6d63e6b60455a77924ec379.png?size=64x64" width="30" style="width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:var(--zds-radius-none);object-fit:contain;overflow:hidden"/></span></div><div class="css-34k981"><span class="css-1ncmxc0"><h2 class="css-12fk9bn">Reply.Reviews</h2></span><div class="css-ims7u7"><p class="css-1pl7f1k">Reply.Reviews is a tool that automates Google review requests after appointments, uses AI agents, and sends personalized human-like replys.</p></div></div></div></a></li><li class="css-oediup"><a aria-label="Shopper Approved integration details" data-testid="category-app-card--item" href="https://zapier.com/apps/shopper-approved/integrations" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="css-ttsy6z"><div class="css-14j7rvi"><div class="css-wmr1hw"><span class="_service-icon_13bft_1" data-border="true" data-shadow="false" data-background="default" data-size="30" data-zds="true" data-testid="ServiceIconShell" style="--width:30px;--height:30px;--border-radius:3px"><img class="_img_nlcen_1" height="20" alt="Shopper Approved logo" aria-hidden="false" data-testid="img" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.zapier.com/img/developer_cli/086a58cdf3def590ac8d895ba947a972.png?size=64x64" width="20" style="width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:var(--zds-radius-none);object-fit:contain;overflow:hidden"/></span></div><div class="css-9y7o3"><span class="_service-icon_13bft_1" data-border="true" data-shadow="false" data-background="default" data-size="40" data-zds="true" data-testid="ServiceIconShell" style="--width:40px;--height:40px;--border-radius:5px"><img class="_img_nlcen_1" height="30" alt="Shopper Approved logo" aria-hidden="false" data-testid="img" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.zapier.com/img/developer_cli/086a58cdf3def590ac8d895ba947a972.png?size=64x64" width="30" style="width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:var(--zds-radius-none);object-fit:contain;overflow:hidden"/></span></div><div class="css-34k981"><span class="css-1ncmxc0"><h2 class="css-12fk9bn">Shopper Approved</h2></span><div class="css-ims7u7"><p class="css-1pl7f1k">Shopper Approved collects, manages, and displays ratings and reviews across the web to help improve and expand your brand&#x27;s reputation and credibility.</p></div></div></div></a></li><li class="css-oediup"><a aria-label="ProvenExpert integration details" data-testid="category-app-card--item" href="https://zapier.com/apps/provenexpert/integrations" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="css-ttsy6z"><div class="css-14j7rvi"><div class="css-wmr1hw"><span class="_service-icon_13bft_1" data-border="true" data-shadow="false" data-background="default" data-size="30" data-zds="